  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangent to the conic, <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></math> touches the circle, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math> (for some fixed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>) at a point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo></math> then <math><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
